#!/usr/bin/env -S python -u

# This script takes .feather files generated by UrbanPop, including both person details and
# daytime-nightime assignments, and converts them into a csv file with the information that is
# needed for ExaEpi. It can use either daytime/nightime files generated by UrbanPop, or it can
# generate the daytime/nightime flows from LODES and school data. This script also generates a c++
# header file containing the structure of the data, including functions for reading and writing
# the data.

